Krizaka UI Builder is a fork of Puck (https://github.com/puckeditor/puck),
Copyright (c) The Puck Contributors, distributed under the MIT License.
The fork started from puckeditor/puck@d14401c3a47947543e9de733ef1a20fb85140d52 (2026-10-31, Puck 0.24.0).
Puck's LICENSE file is kept unchanged; Krizaka's changes are released under the same MIT License.

What Krizaka has changed in Puck (folioviv ADR-010, amended 2026-10-31):
- Added the document format, exported as @krizaka/ui-builder/document: a versioned schema validated with zod,
  nested blocks, content per locale, variables and bindings, with migrations from older documents and from Puck data.
- Added keyboard equivalents (native buttons, Enter, Space, Escape) where the editor had click handlers on containers.
- Removed what Krizaka does not use: rich text (TipTap), external fields, create-puck-app, the Contentful and
  emotion plugins, the heading analyzer, the demo and docs apps and the recipes.
- Renamed the package to @krizaka/ui-builder.

Everything else is Puck 0.24.0 as it was. Changes not made yet are listed as planned in README.md.
The history of every change is the git history of this repository.
